Project: MD4C (Markdown for C), a CommonMark 0.31.2 Markdown parser, with its HTML renderer
URL: https://github.com/mity/md4c
License: MIT (LICENSE.md)
Upstream version: v0.6.0-46-gf9e5eb2, i.e. the master branch 46 commits after
the v0.6.0 tag (7fc1815a5eeba2af7d6120a76202bf59f3b6e6e4, 2026-09-17). These
commits fix bugs of the permissive autolinks that the bundled plug-ins hit (an
URL with a ':' in its path, e.g. a web.archive.org link, was not a link in
v0.6.0) and a quadratic parsing time on a crafted autolink.
Git URL=https://github.com/mity/md4c.git
Git HEAD version=f9e5eb232b95b737373ae706648cb75bd259ed1a (2026-10-19)

Copied files, unmodified:
    LICENSE.md
    src/entity.c
    src/entity.h
    src/md4c.c
    src/md4c.h
    src/md4c-html.c
    src/md4c-html.h

Local modifications: none.

Natron files (not from upstream): README.Natron, CMakeLists.txt, md4c.pro.
The md4c version (`git describe --tags`) is also stated in CMakeLists.txt (md4c_VERSION) and in the
static-md4c section of ../../libs.pri (NATRON_MD4C_VERSION): update them
together. It is shown in the About dialog (AppManager::getMd4cVersion()).

To update:

    git clone https://github.com/mity/md4c.git
    cd md4c
    git checkout <tag or commit>
    cp LICENSE.md /path-to-natron/libs/md4c/
    cp src/entity.[ch] src/md4c.[ch] src/md4c-html.[ch] /path-to-natron/libs/md4c/src/
    cp LICENSE.md /path-to-natron/tools/license/components/LICENSE-md4c.txt

then update this file and the version in CMakeLists.txt and libs.pri, build,
and run the Markdown.* unit tests (Tests/Markdown_Test.cpp).
